Data notice

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository only. It does not
cover the file in data/raw/.

data/raw/flpt-en-2026-07-22.json is the "Check processing times" data feed
published by Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) on canada.ca.
The data belongs to IRCC. It is reproduced here for non-commercial analysis
under the canada.ca Terms and conditions
(https://www.canada.ca/en/transparency/terms.html). It is a copy of the
version that was available at
https://www.canada.ca/content/dam/ircc/documents/json/flpt-en.json on
22 July 2026, and it is not an official version.
